  m_Name: Before Calm
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: Looks like we're at your high school.
    displayText: Looks like we're at your high school.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 2
      parameter:
      - reverse
  - text: Maya said, $$skipping through the hallway as Rika walked behind her.
    displayText: Maya said, skipping through the hallway as Rika walked behind her.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika is trying her best to force herself to create a small smile.
    displayText: Rika is trying her best to force herself to create a small smile.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Her face pale like a paper, $$her body starts to shake. $$$Rika tries to
      stop it$$$$$$, but she can't.
    displayText: Her face pale like a paper, her body starts to shake. Rika tries
      to stop it, but she can't.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1c0000001c0000003600000036000000360000004b0000004b0000004b0000004b0000004b0000004b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```(Everything was fine, really. $$There should be nothing I have to worry
      about.)'
    displayText: (Everything was fine, really. There should be nothing I have to
      worry about.)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```(I just hasn''t visited the school for a long time, $$that''s it.)'
    displayText: (I just hasn't visited the school for a long time, that's it.)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3300000033000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Hey Rika$$, do you think we can get to the lower floor?$$$ Or is it gonna
      be the loopy stair thing?
    displayText: Hey Rika, do you think we can get to the lower floor? Or is it gonna
      be the loopy stair thing?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0800000008000000350000003500000035000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya goes 2-3 steps down$$ then turns around to talk to her, $$at the stairs.
    displayText: Maya goes 2-3 steps down then turns around to talk to her, at the
      stairs.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 18000000180000003b0000003b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The stairs.$.$.
    displayText: The stairs...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000c000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: T$h$e$ $s$t$a$i$r$s$.$.$.$
    displayText: The stairs...
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000030000000400000005000000060000000700000008000000090000000a0000000b0000000c0000000d000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 8
      parameter: []
  - text: "```\u201CRika, $$I really want you to have more fun...\u201D"
    displayText: "\u201CRika, I really want you to have more fun...\u201D"
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0700000007000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "```\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 said, $$as she stared up at Rika from the
      stairs below."
    displayText: "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 said, as she stared up at Rika from the
      stairs below."
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```The sun was setting and it was raining. $$Almost everyone headed home
      by now, $$except for them.'
    displayText: The sun was setting and it was raining. Almost everyone headed home
      by now, except for them.
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 28000000280000004c0000004c000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Rika can't even remember what they're fighting about that day. $$Maybe
      it's \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0's fault, $$maybe it's hers."
    displayText: "Rika can't even remember what they're fighting about that day.
      Maybe it's \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0's fault, maybe it's hers."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3f0000003f0000005800000058000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: $$$$It has to be hers, $$right?
    displayText: It has to be hers, right?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.054
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 000000000000000000000000000000001300000013000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Are we even fighting in the first place?
    displayText: Are we even fighting in the first place?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.054
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika? $$$You don't look fine right now. $$$What happened$.$.$.$?
    displayText: Rika? You don't look fine right now. What happened...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e7de67e2d95a03d4b82bb6e2e759966a, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000000600000025000000250000002500000032000000330000003400000035000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Rika frowned a little bit$$$, staring back at the crying face of her
      friend.'
    displayText: Rika frowned a little bit, staring back at the crying face of her
      friend.
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 190000001900000019000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```"In the end$$$, you didn''t understand me even a bit, $$did you?"'
    displayText: '"In the end, you didn''t understand me even a bit, did you?"'
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000b0000000b0000003200000032000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 8
      parameter: []
  - text: '```Rika turned away. $$$Everything after that seems to pass in a blur,
      $$she can''t remember anymore of it.'
    displayText: Rika turned away. Everything after that seems to pass in a blur,
      she can't remember anymore of it.
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0406
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1200000012000000120000004100000041000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Except the body at the bottom of the stairs.'
    displayText: Except the body at the bottom of the stairs.
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.07
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```T$h$e$ $b$o$d$y$.$.$.$'
    displayText: The body...
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000030000000400000005000000060000000700000008000000090000000a0000000b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```R$$e$$d$$.$$.$$.$$'
    displayText: Red...
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 010000000100000002000000020000000300000003000000040000000400000005000000050000000600000006000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```B$l$o$o$d$ $s$t$a$i$n$.$.$.$'
    displayText: Blood stain...
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000030000000400000005000000060000000700000008000000090000000a0000000b0000000c0000000d0000000e000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 8
      parameter: []
  - text: RIKA!$$$ Can you hear me?!?!
    displayText: RIKA! Can you hear me?!?!
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4e91975d53cca641b0139806b4b5627, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 050000000500000005000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 8
      parameter: []
  - text: "```\u201CWhat do you think? $$Did she kill her?\u201D $$$some guy asked."
    displayText: "\u201CWhat do you think? Did she kill her?\u201D some guy asked."
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1400000014000000270000002700000027000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Did I kill her?'
    displayText: Did I kill her?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "```\u201CWell, they didn't arrest her though$$$, but who knows?$$$ Maybe
      it's true.\u201D "
    displayText: "\u201CWell, they didn't arrest her though, but who knows? Maybe
      it's true.\u201D "
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 240000002400000024000000340000003400000034000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "```\u201CAfter all$$$, she does look a bit anti-social.$$$ She literally
      talks to no one except \u25A0$\u25A0$\u25A0$\u25A0$. \u201D "
    displayText: "\u201CAfter all, she does look a bit anti-social. She literally
      talks to no one except \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. \u201D "
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a0000000a0000002c0000002c0000002c00000053000000540000005500000056000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "```\u201CShe has a motive that makes the most sense.\u201D "
    displayText: "\u201CShe has a motive that makes the most sense.\u201D "
    color: 2
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika hadn't cared about them,$$$ she didn't know them$$$, but what if they
      were right?$$$ It's all her fault$$, after all.
    displayText: Rika hadn't cared about them, she didn't know them, but what if
      they were right? It's all her fault, after all.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d0000001d0000003200000032000000320000005000000050000000500000006300000063000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: G-d - ca-'t br--t-e.
    displayText: G-d - ca-'t br--t-e.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.075
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Someone asks her something$$$, but she can't hear it$$$, not with all these
      noises telling her that it's her fault.
    displayText: Someone asks her something, but she can't hear it, not with all
      these noises telling her that it's her fault.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1a0000001a0000001a000000310000003100000031000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: $$I$ $-$-
    displayText: I --
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.12
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0000000000000000010000000200000003000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She can't breathe.
    displayText: She can't breathe.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika was taking in small$$, harsh breaths. $$$It's not enough.$$$ Everything
      looks blurry$$$, everything sounds muffled.
    displayText: Rika was taking in small, harsh breaths. It's not enough. Everything
      looks blurry, everything sounds muffled.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1800000018000000290000002900000029000000390000003900000039000000510000005100000051000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She felt arms wrap around her$$$, a calm voice told her to breathe.
    displayText: She felt arms wrap around her, a calm voice told her to breathe.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d0000001d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Shhh, $$you don't have to say sorry, $$it's not your fault, $$just breathe.
    displayText: Shhh, you don't have to say sorry, it's not your fault, just breathe.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 060000000600000023000000230000003800000038000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: (Did Maya say something?$$$ Rika didn't even know she was speaking.)
    displayText: (Did Maya say something? Rika didn't even know she was speaking.)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 180000001800000018000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "(She's try to shut up$$$, but she can't control her mouth$$$, she can't
      stop \u2013)"
    displayText: "(She's try to shut up, but she can't control her mouth, she can't
